	(lib_symbols)
	(text_box "Power On\nreset fault line to low (POR)\n\nEnable \"Switch_POS\"\n\nwait 2s (RC Filter settles, tau 500ms)\nsend 10ms pulse to flip flop to take current comparator value -> SET ISO H OK Bit\nEnable \"Switch_NEG\" with logik connection to \"Switch_POS\" so that it only turns on when \"Switch_POS\" is Low\non falling edge of 10ms pulse Disable \"Switch_POS\"\n\nwait 2s (RC Filter settles, tau 500ms)\nsend 10ms pulse to flip flop to take current comparator value -> SET ISO L OK Bit\nEnable \"Switch_RTest_POS\" with logik connection to \"Switch_NEG\" so that it only turns on when \"Switch_NEG\" is Low\nminimal delay 10ms ( can be done locally with the flip flop pulse and small delay block )\nDisable \"Switch_NEG\"\n\nwait 2s (RC Filter settles, tau 500ms)\nsend 10ms pulse to flip flop to take current comparator value -> SET Test H OK Bit\nEnable \"Switch_RTest_NEG\" with logik connection to \"Switch_RTest_POS\" so that it only turns on when \"Switch_RTest_POS\" is Low\nminimal delay 10ms ( can be done locally with the flip flop pulse and small delay block )\nDisable \"Switch_RTest_POS\"\n\n\nwait 2s (RC Filter settles, tau 500ms)\nsend pulse to flip flop to take current comparator value -> SET Test L OK Bit\nEnable \"Switch_POS\" with logik connection to \"Switch_RTest_NEG\" so that it only turns on when \"Switch_RTest_NEG\" is Low\nminimal delay 10ms ( can be done locally with the flip flop pulse and small delay block )\nDisable \"Switch_RTest_NEG\"\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 490.22 -8.89 0)
		(size 62.23 85.09)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
