	(text_box "Funktionsablauf\nPower On\nset fault line to low, Fault ist low active\nErste messung started\n\nEnable \"Switch_POS\"\nwait 500ms\nenable averaging of SE_VIso und SE_VDC\nwait 2000ms\nCompare if Iso Value is greater than threshold -> SET ISO H OK Bit\nDisable \"Switch_POS\"\n\nwait 50ms\n\nEnable \"Switch_ENG\"\nwait 500ms\nenable averaging of SE_VIso und SE_VDC\nwait 2000ms\nCompare if Iso Value is greater than threshold -> SET ISO L OK Bit\nDisable \"Switch_NEG\"\n\nwait 50ms\n\nEnable \"Switch_RTest_POS\"\nwait 500ms\nenable averaging of SE_VIso und SE_VDC\nwait 2000ms\nCompare if Iso Value is equal with tolerance to 330kOhm +- 5% -> SET Seltest H OK Bit\nDisable \"Switch_RTest_POS\"\n\nwait 50ms\n\nEnable \"Switch_RTest_NEG\"\nwait 500ms\nenable averaging of SE_VIso und SE_VDC\nwait 2000ms\nCompare if Iso Value is equal with tolerance to 330kOhm +- 5% -> SET Seltest L OK Bit\nDisable \"Switch_RTest_NEG\"\n\nIf all bits are set to 1 and fault output is low set fault line high (Fault not active) else set fault line low"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
